// feature set are (C) RiftwayLabs:
//   - Launchpad Pro MK3 Programmer-mode pad map + send-on-change LED engine.
//   - Per-track CLEAR / MUTE / SOLO; per-track INDEPENDENT loop lengths
//     (samples + bars), playback position, record tempo, sync mode
//     (FREE / MEASURE_SYNC / MASTER_SYNC, default MEASURE_SYNC), quantize
//     (off / beat / bar, default bar). First synced recording defines the base
//     measure; later synced tracks arm at a downbeat and snap to a whole
//     multiple (1-bar drums + 8-bar guitar stay bar-aligned); FREE tracks run
//     off-grid. Named action dispatcher (Launchpad row 2 / action slider).
//   - Arm bridge: publishes per-track want-input state via gmem to a ReaScript.
//
